---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: contract not paused
    q_check_published --> q_revert_state: results not published or acceptedCapital merkle not set
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_published --> q_check_claimed: results published
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_dup: position.hasClaimedExcess == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ExcessAlreadyClaimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: excess not yet claimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: Merkle proof invalid
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_excess: proof valid, decode acceptedAmount
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excess = position.investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_zero: excess <= 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_check_excess --> q_update_state: excess > 0
    q_update_state --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, excess), emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: Merkle proof verifies accepted capital amount per investor
        INV-002: excess = investedCapital - acceptedCapital
    end note

    note right of q_update_state
        INV-003: excess claim is one-time per investor
        INV-004: state update before transfer (reentrancy protection)
    end note
